      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　もたせると\nピンチのとき　じぶんの\nとくぼうが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 지니게 하면\n위급할 때 자신의\n특수방어가 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tenue, cette Baie augmente la Défense Spéciale\nen cas de besoin.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Als getragenes Item erhöht diese Beere den\nSpezial-Verteidigungs-Wert eines Pokémon,\nsobald es in einer Notlage steckt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Polvo de brillo argénteo que fortalece los ataques\nde tipo Bicho. Debe llevarlo un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se il Pokémon che ha questa bacca si trova\nin difficoltà, la sua Difesa Speciale aumenta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Berry to be consumed by Pokémon.\nIf a Pokémon holds one, its Sp. Def\nstat will increase when it’s in a pinch.",
